            "review_title": "Review at Ashima 2",
            "review_text": "TravelWanderlust90\nLondon, United Kingdom124 contributions\n0\nGood hotpot but lack of service\nSep 2017 • Friends\nI've been to this branch with friends on Saturday night, it was almost full and we were turned away. However we were lucky enough to be offered a table near the main door as one booking did not turn up.\n\nsalon sashimiss is good but not too fresh, hotpot with mushroom and quail broth is nice.\nIt is quite expensive as 3 of us paid nealy 1 million vnd for the food and 3 cups of tea.\nNot sure if I'd make a return here\nRead more\nWritten September 27, 2017",
