            "review_title": "Review at Ashima 2",
            "review_text": "Matteo G\nMilan, Italy327 contributions\n0\nExquisite food and service\nJun 2015 • Solo\nI entered this place noticing only once my first step was actually inside the restaurant that it is a all you can eat. I normally don't like such places. Nevertheless they don't offer all you can eat to single guest then I had a look to the menu and I noticed that main dish is mushrooms and I literally love them. Hot pot of mushrooms! To which I added few slices of beef. Wonderful combination.\nPrice is very cheap and oh my god, the service is amazing. For the entire meal the waiter, gratuitous and very elegant, stayed next to my table refilling my cup whenever I emptied it. Always smiling.\nPrice is less than cheap and it is one of the few places in Hanoi where you can have an invoice. So if you travel for work it means claim note.\nRead more\nWritten June 29, 2015\nGolden Gate Restaurant Group\nThank you for posting your great and detailed review! I greatly appreciate your comments about our food and service. We hope to see you again in the future and wish you the very best.!!=)\nRead more\nWritten July 10, 2015\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
